(20, 'NCT03130426', 'Remission Evaluation of a Metabolic Intervention for Type 2 Diabetes With IGlarLixi', 'Remission Evaluation of a Metabolic Intervention for Type 2 Diabetes With IGlarLixi', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE3', 161, '2017-06-27', '2019-06-30', '2020-09-30', 'The purpose of the study is to determine whether in patients with early type 2 diabetes, a short-term intensive metabolic intervention comprising iGlarLixi, metformin, and lifestyle approaches will be superior to standard diabetes therapy in achieving sustained diabetes remission.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

