* At risk for Type 2 diabetes;
* Adult (aged 19-50).

Exclusion Criteria:

* Individuals with Type 2 diabetes;
* Chronic conditions or injuries that would impact exercise;
* Regular exercise training.', '19 Years', '50 Years', 'ALL', 49),
(57, 'NCT01238289', 'Randomized Trial of Peer Led Education-Project Dulce', 'Peer-Led Diabetes Education Programs in High Risk Mexican Americans Evaluates Glycemic Control Compared to Standard Approaches: A Project Dulce™ Promotora Randomized Trial', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 207, '2006-09-01', '2009-03-01', '2010-02-01', 'The purpose of this study is to evaluate the effect of a culturally sensitive diabetes self-management program on glucose control and metabolic parameters in low income Mexican-Americans with type 2 diabetes using the Project Dulce model utilizing a low cost, peer-educator format.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

