(62, 'NCT02307279', 'Study of Gelesis100 on Body Weight in Overweight and Obese Subjects With and Without Type 2 Diabetes', 'A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Parallel-Group Study Assessing the Effect of Gelesis100 on Body Weight in Overweight and Obese Subjects With and Without Type 2 Diabetes', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 436, '2014-11-01', '2017-06-01', '2017-06-01', 'This study will asses the decrease in body weight after repeated administration of Gelesis100 in overweight and obese subjects with and without Type 2 Diabetes.', 0, 1, 'Inclusion Criteria:

