(63, 'NCT01874366', 'Determination of Safety,Tolerability,Pharmacokinetics,Food Effect& Pharmacodynamics of Single & Multiple Doses of P11187', 'A Phase I, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Study to Determine the Safety, Tolerability, Pharmacokinetics, Food Effect and Pharmacodynamics of Single and Multiple Ascending Doses of P11187', 'UNKNOWN', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE1', 96, '2013-06-01', '2015-10-01', '2015-12-01', '* Study to Determine the Safety, Tolerability, Pharmacokinetics, Food Effect and Pharmacodynamics of Single and Multiple Ascending Doses of P11187
* It will be conducted in three parts, as described below:
