(69, 'NCT04953442', 'Fit 24 Technology Intervention YOUTH', 'Fit 24: Using Technology to Improve Activity and Sleep in Hispanic Youth', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 43, '2021-04-15', '2024-03-29', '2024-04-28', 'The purpose of this study is to examine the effects of a goal-setting intervention that utilizes a Fitbit device and text messaging to improve physical activity and sleep in Hispanic adolescents with obesity.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

