* Allergy to vitamins', '30 Years', '75 Years', 'ALL', 89),
(116, 'NCT01326299', 'Post Prandial Glucose Control Proof-of-Principle', 'Post Prandial Glucose Control Proof-of-Principle', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE2', 50, '2010-08-01', '2010-09-01', '2010-09-01', 'The purpose of this study is to compare the postprandial glycemic response of subjects with type 2 diabetes when consuming a meal along with beverages containing various combinations of nutritional ingredients and fibers versus control beverage.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

