(117, 'NCT03862716', 'Remission Evaluation of a Metabolic Intervention for Type 2 Diabetes With IDegLira', 'Remission Evaluation of a Metabolic Intervention for Type 2 Diabetes With IDegLira (REMIT IDegLira): A Randomized Controlled Trial', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE3', 159, '2019-04-23', '2022-06-15', '2023-07-31', 'The purpose of the study is to determine whether in patients with early type 2 diabetes, a short-term intensive metabolic intervention comprising IDegLira, metformin, and lifestyle approaches will be superior to standard diabetes therapy in achieving sustained diabetes remission.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

