(208, 'NCT06190158', 'Subclinical Primary Aldosteronism in Diabetes At-Risk for Kidney Disease', 'Subclinical Primary Aldosteronism in Diabetes At-Risk for Kidney Disease', 'RECRUITING', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'EARLY_PHASE1', 125, '2024-05-15', '2029-07-31', '2029-07-31', 'The aim of this protocol is to assess the presence and severity of primary aldosteronism pathophysiology in patients with type 2 diabetes who have, or are at-risk for developing, chronic kidney disease.', 1, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

