(211, 'NCT01876849', 'An Open-Label Study Examining the Long-Term Safety of Exenatide Given Twice Daily to Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus', 'An Open-Label Study Examining the Long-Term Safety of Exenatide Given Twice Daily to Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE3', 275, '2003-12-01', '2008-07-01', '2008-07-01', 'The aim of this study is to assess the long-term safety of exenatide in patients with type 2 diabetes who were treated with exenatide in Study H8O-MC-GWAA (6-month study) or Study H8O-MC-GWAD (12-month study). Study H8O-MC-GWAN serves as an open-ended extension to Studies H8O-MC-GWAA and H8O-MC-GWAD.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

