(229, 'NCT04215328', 'Facilitated Release of Endogenous Enterokines', 'Facilitated Release of Endogenous Enterokines: An Ambulatory Prospective Randomized Controlled Trial', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 16, '2014-11-01', '2019-02-28', '2019-02-28', 'The overall objective is to develop therapy for obesity and diabetes that is as effective as gastric bypass surgery but without the cost and safety concerns.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

