* Does not have a computer and/or Internet access', '18 Years', '65 Years', 'ALL', 77),
(249, 'NCT06124547', 'Bioequivalence Study of Sitagliptin Hydrochloride / Metformin Hydrochloride Extended-release Film Coated Tablets 50 mg /500 mg (FDC) in Healthy Adult Male and Female Subjects Under Fed Conditions.', 'An Oral Single-dose, Randomized, Balanced, Open-label, Two-sequence, Two-treatment, Two-period, Crossover Bioequivalence Study of Sitagliptin Hydrochloride / Metformin Hydrochloride Extended Release Film Coated Tablets 50 mg / 500 mg (FDC) of Galenicum Health S.L.U., Spain With That of JANUMET® XR (Sitagliptin Phosphate / Metformin Hydrochloride) Extended-release Coated Tablets 50 mg / 500 mg (FDC) of Merck Sharp & Dohme Pharmaceuticals Ltd., Brazilin Healthy Adult Male and Female Subjects Under Fed Conditions.', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE1', 48, '2023-01-16', '2023-02-13', '2023-02-13', 'The objective of this study was to evaluate and compare the bioavailability and therefore to assess the bioequivalence of two different formulations of sitagliptin/metformin extended release tablets after a single oral dose administration under fed conditions.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

1. Healthy adult male and female subjects aged ≥ 18 and ≤ 55 years.
