18. Have a positive result for the alcohol test (breath / saliva) or drugs of abuse test \\[Cannabinoids (Marijuana/Tetrahydrocannabinol-THC), Cocaine, Opiates/Morphine, Amphetamine, Methamphetamine and Benzodiazepines\\] performed during screening.
