(282, 'NCT02322762', 'DISCOVERing Treatment Reality of Type 2 Diabetes in Real World Settings', 'DISCOVERing Treatment Reality of Type 2 Diabetes in Real World Settings', 'COMPLETED', 'OBSERVATIONAL', 'N/A', 15992, '2014-12-30', '2019-08-21', '2019-08-21', 'DISCOVER is a Non Interventional Study study to describe the disease management patterns and clinical evolution over three years in type 2 diabetes mellitus patients initiating a second line anti-diabetic treatment.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

