(388, 'NCT04341935', 'Effects of DPP4 Inhibition on COVID-19', 'Effects of DPP4 Inhibition on COVID-19 Patients With Type 2 Diabetes', 'WITHDRAWN', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE4', 0, '2021-06-30', '2021-12-30', '2021-12-30', 'The purpose of this research is to see if the DPP4 inhibitor linagliptin, an oral medication commonly used to treat type 2 diabetes,can help with diabetes control and reduce the severity of the COVID-19 infection', 1, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

