(410, 'NCT03121508', 'Taking on Diabetes to Advance You (TODAY)', 'Taking on Diabetes to Advance You', 'WITHDRAWN', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 0, '2017-04-24', '2018-04-24', '2018-06-24', 'The program will consist of diabetes self-management sessions, led by an occupational therapist. The sessions will be held in an individualized format. Sessions will focus on diabetes education, self-management education, and education on behaviors and adaptive techniques to optimize participation in daily life with type II diabetes. As occupational therapists, the investigators and facilitator, aim to focus on establishing healthy habits, roles, and routines for individuals with type 2 diabetes.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

