(418, 'NCT01889667', 'Safety, Pharmacokinetics (PK) and Pharmacodynamics (PD) of Multiple Oral Bedtime Doses of ORMD-0801 in Adult Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus (T2DM)', 'Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Study to Assess the Safety, PK and PD of Multiple Oral Bedtime Doses of ORMD-0801 in Adult Patients With T2DM Who Are Inadequately Controlled With Diet and Exercise or Diet, Exercise and Metformin', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE2', 30, '2013-06-01', '2013-11-01', '2013-11-01', 'The purpose of this study is to test the safety and pharmacodynamics of an oral formulation of insulin in subjects with Type 2 Diabetes.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

* Male or female patients, age 20 to 70 years, inclusive with T2DM;
