(430, 'NCT01527747', 'Effects of DPP-4 Inhibition on Triglycerides', 'Effects of Dipeptidyl Peptidase-4 Inhibition With Saxagliptin on Fasting and Postprandial Triglyceride Concentrations', 'SUSPENDED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE4', 15, '2012-01-01', '2024-11-01', '2024-12-01', 'The purpose of this study is to test the effects of saxagliptin, a treatment for diabetes, on fasting and post-meal blood triglyceride (blood fat) levels.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

