(431, 'NCT05195138', 'Mindfulness-Based Diabetes Education for Adults With Elevated Diabetes Distress', 'Mindfulness-Based Diabetes Education for Adults With Elevated Diabetes Distress', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 36, '2023-05-31', '2025-12-31', '2025-12-31', 'Diabetes distress is common affecting over one-third of people with type 2 diabetes, negatively impacting self-management and outcomes, and disproportionately affecting low-income individuals. The proposed project will conduct a pilot randomized controlled trial comparing Mindfulness-Based Diabetes Education to standard Diabetes Self-Management Education in adults with type 2 diabetes and elevated diabetes distress who receive care within safety-net healthcare systems in order to assess feasibility and acceptability.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

