(448, 'NCT06382259', 'The Acute Effect of Low-intensity Movement Breaks on Glycemic Responses in Individuals With Type 2 Diabetes.', 'The Acute Effect of Low-intensity Movement Breaks on Glycemic Responses in Individuals With Type 2 Diabetes: a Randomized Controlled Crossover Trial', 'RECRUITING', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 30, '2024-04-25', '2025-07-15', '2025-07-15', 'To conduct a randomized crossover trial to determine the acute impact of low-intensity movement breaks on glycemic control in physically inactive individuals living with type 2 diabetes using continuous glucose monitoring.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

* Aged 30-75 years old.
