(544, 'NCT00299871', 'Dose Ranging Study of the GLP-1 Agonist AVE0010 in Metformin-Treated Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus', 'A 13-week Multinational, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Dose-Response Trial Assessing the Safety, Tolerability and Efficacy of AVE0010 in Metformin-Treated Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE2', 542, '2006-02-01', '2007-08-01', '2007-08-01', 'To evaluate the dose-response relationship of AVE0010 administered once daily and twice daily with chronic dosing in metformin-treated subjects with type 2 diabetes', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

