* Be willing and able to obtain HbA1c every 3 months

Exclusion Criteria:

* none', '18 Years', NULL, 'ALL', 276),
(575, 'NCT01469312', 'Effect of Pasta on Blood Glucose Response in Normal Subjects', 'Effect of Pasta on Blood Glucose Response in Normal Subjects', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 20, '2010-04-01', '2011-10-01', '2011-10-01', 'The objective of this study is to determine whether ingestion of modified pasta products (Dreamfields, Miracle Noodles) result in an improvement in blood glucose concentration when compared with a traditional pasta.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

