(585, 'NCT00940472', 'Study on DMMET-01 Versus Metformin on Improvement of Metabolic Control in Naive Type 2 Diabetes Patients', 'Randomized, Double-Blind, Efficacy and Safety, Controlled Study, Between DMMET-01 and Metformin on Improvement of Metabolic Control in Naive Type 2 Diabetics Patients.', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE2', 20, '2009-03-01', '2009-12-01', NULL, 'The aim of this clinical trial is to compare the efficacy of DMMET-01 versus metformin hydrocloride on metabolic control in mexican type 2 diabetes patients without prior pharmacological treatment.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

