(592, 'NCT05919667', 'Dairy and Non-Dairy Alternatives Comparative on Metabolic Outcomes', 'The Effects of Dairy and Non-Dairy Alternatives on Glycemic and Appetite Regulation in Healthy Young Adults', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 16, '2022-02-28', '2022-02-28', '2023-03-31', 'The purpose of this study is to compare the acute effects of a single serving of dairy and non-dairy alternatives on post-treatment and post-meal glycemia, appetite, plasma amino acid concentrations, and gastrointestinal hormones levels.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

