(784, 'NCT07271043', 'Nutrition+: Effect of a High-Protein Diabetes Formula on Body Composition in Type 2 Diabetes Patients Treated With Incretin Mimetics', 'Evaluating the Efficacy of High-Protein Diabetes Specific Formula (HP-DSF) on Body Composition in Overweight/Obese Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Treated With Incretin Mimetic Drugs', 'RECRUITING', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 60, '2026-01-01', '2026-11-01', '2026-12-01', 'A randomized clinical study to assess the efficacy of a high-protein diabetes specific formula (HPDSF) on lean muscle mass in overweight and obese patients with type 2 diabetes who are initiating treatment with incretin-mimetic drugs.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

