(791, 'NCT02700503', 'Finding the Patient\'s Voice Diabetes Prevention Programs', 'Finding the Patient\'s Voice: Development of Practical Approaches for Adolescent and Family Focused Diabetes Prevention Programs', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 146, '2015-11-01', '2019-06-01', '2019-06-01', 'This study uses patient engagement to develop a diabetes prevention program focused on adolescents and families.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

