Exclusion Criteria:

* BMI \\>35 kg/m2
* Hypertensive (brachial systolic BP ≥140mmHg and/or diastolic BP ≥90mmHg)
* Pregnant women, or those at risk of pregnancy, or breastfeeding at the time of the study.
