* Subjects who are receiving systemic glucocorticoids (≥14 days)', '18 Years', '65 Years', 'ALL', 54),
(839, 'NCT00690755', 'Defective Atypical Protein Kinase C (PKC) Activation in Diabetes and Metabolic Syndrome', 'Defective Atypical PKC Activation in Diabetes and Metabolic Syndrome', 'COMPLETED', 'OBSERVATIONAL', 'N/A', 157, '2000-05-01', '2012-09-01', '2012-09-01', 'The investigators are examining the activation of insulin signaling factors in skeletal muscles of human diabetics. The investigators are characterizing the defects in signaling, and are examining the effects of anti-diabetic agents and exercise on signaling to glucose transport biochemical machinery and whole body glucose disposal.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

