(848, 'NCT01882036', 'Bariatric Surgery And Adipose Inflammation Dysfunction and Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus', 'The Effects of Roux-en-Y Gastric Bypass on Mitochondrial Dysfunction and Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 57, '2011-11-01', '2018-07-10', '2018-07-10', 'The focus of this proposal is to define the mechanism by which bariatric surgery acutely improves insulin sensitivity. Our central hypothesis is that drastically reduced caloric intake early after Bariatric surgery improves the pro-inflammatory profile of macrophages, which in turn improves insulin sensitivity and glucose homeostasis.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria::

