* any oral anti-hyperglycemic medication, other than metformin monotherapy, during last 3 months', '30 Years', '75 Years', 'ALL', 3),
(937, 'NCT06080451', 'Implementing HEARTS in Guatemala', 'Implementing Integrated Diabetes and Hypertension Management in Guatemala Using the HEARTS Model', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 964, '2023-10-03', '2024-05-27', '2024-05-27', 'The HEARTS Technical Package was developed by the World Health Organization to address the implementation gap of cardiovascular disease prevention in low- and middle-income countries. Guatemala is a middle-income country that is currently implementing HEARTS. National authorities are interested in exploring how hypertension and diabetes management can be integrated in HEARTS implementation. The objective of this study is to conduct a feasibility and acceptability pilot trial of integrated hypertension and diabetes management based on HEARTS in the publicly funded primary care system in Guatemala.', 0, 0, 'Patient participants

