* systemic glucocorticoid therapy', '18 Years', NULL, 'ALL', 29),
(957, 'NCT06370494', 'Testing New Models of Diabetes Self-Management to Improve Population Health', 'Testing New Models of Diabetes Self-Management to Improve Population Health', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'NA', 191, '2019-02-01', '2022-03-31', '2022-03-31', 'Aim 1.1 To understand if diabetes self-management education and support (DSMES) improves diabetes-related outcomes among those with Type 2 diabetes living in Texas.

Aim 1.2 To examine how rurality affects study participation, engagement in, and effectiveness of different education interventions.

These aims are based on a randomized controlled trial of different evidence-based diabetes self-management interventions.', 0, 0, 'Inclusion Criteria:

