(421, 'NCT03217591', 'A Study to Evaluate the Soluble Guanylate Cyclase (sGC) Stimulator IW-1973 in Diabetic Nephropathy / Diabetic Kidney Disease as Measured by Albuminuria', 'A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Phase 2 Study to Evaluate the Safety and Efficacy of IW-1973 in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes With Albuminuria Treated With Renin-Angiotensin System Inhibitors', 'COMPLETED', 'INTERVENTIONAL', 'PHASE2', 156, '2017-08-01', '2019-08-20', '2019-08-20', 'To evaluate the safety and efficacy of IW-1973 in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus with albuminuria who are on a stable regimen of renin-angiotensin system inhibitors.', 1, 0, 'Key Inclusion Criteria:
